[{"sha":"863cabcba8e5b15b6e4e5776d0d345ce211557bb","filename":".agents/skills/bandit-substantive-advance/SKILL.md","status":"modified","additions":39,"deletions":3,"changes":42,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/.agents%2Fskills%2Fbandit-substantive-advance%2FSKILL.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/.agents%2Fskills%2Fbandit-substantive-advance%2FSKILL.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/.agents%2Fskills%2Fbandit-substantive-advance%2FSKILL.md?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -1,9 +1,12 @@\n # BanditRLlib substantive advance\n \n+Read `docs/proof-digestion-protocol.md` and `docs/evidence-routed-memory-protocol.md` before source-facing proof work.\n A substantive advance is one bounded mathematical or publication delta that changes the maintained theorem/route graph.\n \n ## Before work\n \n+For a new or materially changed source-facing Anchor, first complete the Statement Seal. New source-facing manifests should use contribution-contract schema 3.0 and fill `learning_contract`. Consult curated process/negative memory before dispatch; the control plane may choose the next process but may not invent mathematical conclusions. Expand project-owned assumption bundles, reject `EXCESS` binders, and keep every proof ingredient as a dependency edge rather than a new public premise. Reconstruct source proof topology independently of implementation Lean; every substantive source region is `NODE` or `EXCLUDED(reason)`, missing bridges are `SOURCE_GAP`, and alternative sufficient proofs are OR-routes.\n+\n Return:\n \n - source anchor;\n@@ -54,6 +57,37 @@ graph_contribution:\n   lean_graph:\n   overview_graph:\n   functor_hypergraph:\n+learning_contract:\n+  control_plane_math_authority: false\n+  process_memory_checked: true\n+  process_memory_ids: []\n+  failure_class: NONE | REFUTED | SOURCE_INVALID | API_BLOCKED | ENV_BLOCKED | IMPLEMENTATION_FAILED\n+  salvage:\n+    required: false\n+    status: not-applicable | pending | completed\n+    reason:\n+    promoted_fragments: []\n+    discarded_fragments: []\n+  parallelism:\n+    decision: serial | parallel\n+    direction_fingerprints: []\n+    expected_information_gain:\n+    shared_verified_context_digest:\n+  cross_route_blind_spot_audit:\n+    required: false\n+    status: not-applicable | pending | accepted\n+    evidence:\n+    canonical_route:\n+    selection_reason:\n+  reader_backpressure:\n+    purification_status: pending | purified | not-applicable\n+    exposition_seal_status: pending | accepted | not-applicable\n+    reader_debt_delta: 0\n+    exposition_evidence:\n+    source_expansion_nodes: []\n+    lean_expansion_nodes: []\n+    assumptions_preserved: false\n+    boundary_preserved: false\n progress_updates:\n truth_boundary:\n verification:\n@@ -77,10 +111,12 @@ For source-facing theorems all of:\n \n ## Blocker discipline\n \n-A blocked result must identify the exact obstruction and strictly reduce the next boundary. Examples: missing measurability producer, false statement under stated assumptions, change-of-measure mismatch, source ambiguity, unavailable API, or theorem too large.\n+A blocked result must identify the exact obstruction and strictly reduce the next boundary. Before scheduling, classify it as REFUTED / SOURCE_INVALID / API_BLOCKED / ENV_BLOCKED / IMPLEMENTATION_FAILED. Every non-NONE failure receives an explicit salvage audit. API/environment/implementation failures may not retire the mathematical target. Multiple serious parallel routes require distinct direction fingerprints and a common-blind-spot review.\n+\n+## Stabilization and purification\n \n-## Stabilization\n+Rebase/clean-port current main; update shared imports/tests, canonical route/progress data, source mapping, Source Proof Graph, Lean Graph, candidate Compressed Bandit/RL Spine, Functor Hypergraph, reader pages, and contributor credit only where affected.\n \n-Rebase/clean-port current main; update shared imports/tests, canonical route/progress data, source mapping, Lean Graph, Functor Hypergraph, reader pages, and contributor credit only where affected.\n+After merge, `MERGED` remains an integration state. Do not call a source route fully digested until the purification pass has removed dead/duplicate/wrapper-only residue, canonicalized reusable primitives, compressed bookkeeping while retaining drill-down evidence, and marked the result `PURIFIED`.\n \n Run the contract, Lean, site, and diff gates before merge."},{"sha":"95a99264ea83fc0d156a49df0388172c185fd8a0","filename":".gitattributes","status":"modified","additions":6,"deletions":0,"changes":6,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/.gitattributes","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/.gitattributes","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/.gitattributes?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -23,3 +23,9 @@ Tests/OnlineWeightedPotentialCanary.lean text eol=lf\n docs/contracts/online-ch2-weighted-identity-v1/canary-neutral-imported-definitions-v1.txt whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof\n BanditRLProof/OnlineUnboundedOGD.lean text eol=lf\n Tests/OnlineUnboundedOGDCanary.lean text eol=lf\n+\n+# Prescient Euclidean frozen producer and complete canary sources\n+BanditRLProof/OnlinePrescientEuclidean.lean text eol=lf\n+Tests/OnlinePrescientEuclideanCanary.lean text eol=lf\n+# Keep the shared source manifest portable across Windows/Linux.\n+MANIFEST.md text eol=lf"},{"sha":"af2578b21b882130911c7b4b30187b36fb7217a1","filename":".github/workflows/contributor-contract.yml","status":"modified","additions":4,"deletions":1,"changes":5,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/.github%2Fworkflows%2Fcontributor-contract.yml","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/.github%2Fworkflows%2Fcontributor-contract.yml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/.github%2Fworkflows%2Fcontributor-contract.yml?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -20,7 +20,10 @@ jobs:\n         with:\n           python-version: \"3.12\"\n       - name: Test contributor contract invariants\n-        run: python3 -m unittest tools.test_contributor_contract\n+        run: python3 -m unittest tools.test_contributor_contract tools.test_process_memory\n+\n+      - name: Validate evidence-routed process memory\n+        run: python3 tools/check_process_memory.py check\n \n       - name: Validate affected contribution contracts\n         env:"},{"sha":"3d92c74f8c60290fbe5633e86953dfb51c39d3eb","filename":".github/workflows/documentation.yml","status":"modified","additions":4,"deletions":1,"changes":5,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/.github%2Fworkflows%2Fdocumentation.yml","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/.github%2Fworkflows%2Fdocumentation.yml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/.github%2Fworkflows%2Fdocumentation.yml?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -28,9 +28,12 @@ jobs:\n         env:\n           CONTRIBUTOR_BASE: ${{ github.event.pull_request.base.sha || github.event.merge_group.base_sha || github.event.before || github.sha }}\n         run: |\n-          python3 -m unittest tools.test_contributor_contract\n+          python3 -m unittest tools.test_contributor_contract tools.test_process_memory\n           python3 tools/check_contributor_contract.py --ci\n \n+      - name: Validate evidence-routed process memory\n+        run: python3 tools/check_process_memory.py check\n+\n       - name: Set up Lean and fetch the Mathlib cache\n         uses: leanprover/lean-action@v1\n         with:"},{"sha":"d21d33abfab601b46de350c5d124c8f9231dde5d","filename":"AGENTS.md","status":"modified","additions":23,"deletions":5,"changes":28,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/AGENTS.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/AGENTS.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/AGENTS.md?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -17,10 +17,12 @@ Every collaborator and every Codex/ChatGPT/Claude agent acting for a collaborato\n 2. `CONTRIBUTING.md`\n 3. `docs/contributor-codex-contract.md`\n 4. `docs/theorem-publication-protocol.md`\n-5. `.agents/skills/bandit-substantive-advance/SKILL.md`\n-6. `.agents/skills/bandit-semantic-roundtrip/SKILL.md`\n-7. the relevant domain skill under `.agents/skills/`\n-8. the exact route/source files being changed.\n+5. `docs/proof-digestion-protocol.md`\n+6. `docs/evidence-routed-memory-protocol.md`\n+7. `.agents/skills/bandit-substantive-advance/SKILL.md`\n+8. `.agents/skills/bandit-semantic-roundtrip/SKILL.md`\n+9. the relevant domain skill under `.agents/skills/`\n+10. the exact route/source files being changed.\n \n Repository-local instructions override copied prompts from chat.\n \n@@ -58,7 +60,7 @@ If a lower-level lemma has at least two real consumers, prefer one canonical sha\n \n ## Source and reader publication contract\n \n-Every new or changed source-facing production declaration follows `docs/theorem-publication-protocol.md`.\n+Every new or changed source-facing production declaration follows `docs/theorem-publication-protocol.md`, `docs/proof-digestion-protocol.md`, and `docs/evidence-routed-memory-protocol.md`. The exact source-facing signature is sealed before proof search; every binder is expanded/classified; proof ingredients remain dependency edges rather than new public hypotheses; source proof topology is reconstructed independently of implementation Lean; and a merged proof is not reader-facing complete until purification removes dead/duplicate/wrapper-only residue and exposes the compressed Bandit/RL spine. Failed routes are typed before they influence scheduling, verified fragments are salvaged before deletion, process memory is evidence-bound, scheduler defaults remain matched-experiment gated, and parallel proof directions require a common-blind-spot review.\n \n The reader-facing page must keep the following adjacent and in mathematical order:\n \n@@ -178,3 +180,19 @@ Repeated failure is information. Stop blind tactic search when the same route fa\n ## Minimal Codex bootstrap\n \n Use `.agents/prompts/collaborator-contribution.md`. Its role is only to point Codex to the current repository contract; it is not a second copy of these rules.\n+\n+\n+## OpenAI Math upstream assimilation\n+\n+Before using `openai/math`, read `docs/openai-math-assimilation-protocol.md`\n+and `research-wiki/openai-math-2026-intake.json`. The intake is commit pinned;\n+a floating upstream `main` is never source evidence.\n+\n+The current audited snapshot has no direct bandit or reinforcement-learning Lean\n+cluster. Therefore prophet/secretary results are adjacent online-selection\n+routes, while Boolean/Gaussian information and memory lower-bound developments\n+are candidate technical substrates. They do not count toward a bandit/RL route\n+until an explicit ABRL experiment/feedback-model adapter or reduction is locally\n+proved. Keyword matches such as edit-distance “regret” are not semantic matches.\n+All promoted items still require the normal source round trip, hypothesis audit,\n+local Lean evidence, and Lean/Overview/Functor graph classification."},{"sha":"cab79ea16e0ea3decae35630c8a626cde92427bf","filename":"BanditRLProof.lean","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/BanditRLProof.lean","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/BanditRLProof.lean","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/BanditRLProof.lean?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -792,3 +792,4 @@ import BanditRLProof.OnlineAdaptiveOSD\n import BanditRLProof.OnlineAdaptiveBenchmark\n import BanditRLProof.OnlineWeightedPotential\n import BanditRLProof.OnlineUnboundedOGD\n+import BanditRLProof.OnlinePrescientEuclidean"},{"sha":"7c2ba5c5a3eac00e43c06256380db710c8a541b5","filename":"BanditRLProof/OnlinePrescientEuclidean.lean","status":"added","additions":164,"deletions":0,"changes":164,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/BanditRLProof%2FOnlinePrescientEuclidean.lean","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/BanditRLProof%2FOnlinePrescientEuclidean.lean","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/BanditRLProof%2FOnlinePrescientEuclidean.lean?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,164 @@\n+import BanditRLProof.OnlinePrescientBregmanSource\n+import Mathlib.Analysis.InnerProductSpace.Calculus\n+import Mathlib.Analysis.Convex.Strong\n+import Mathlib.Tactic\n+\n+noncomputable section\n+open Set Finset\n+open BanditRL.OnlineBregman\n+set_option autoImplicit false\n+\n+namespace BanditRL.OnlineBregman\n+\n+variable {E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E] [CompleteSpace E]\n+\n+theorem quadratic_geometry (x y : E) :\n+    HasGradientAt (fun z : E => ‖z‖ ^ 2 / 2) y y ∧\n+    divergence (fun z : E => ‖z‖ ^ 2 / 2) x y = ‖x - y‖ ^ 2 / 2 := by\n+  have hg : HasGradientAt (fun z : E => ‖z‖ ^ 2 / 2) y y := by\n+    rw [hasGradientAt_iff_hasFDerivAt]\n+    convert ((hasStrictFDerivAt_norm_sq y).hasFDerivAt.const_smul (1 / 2 : ℝ)) using 1\n+    · ext z\n+      change ‖z‖ ^ 2 / 2 = (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ‖z‖ ^ 2\n+      ring\n+    · ext z\n+      simp only [ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, innerSL_apply_apply,\n+        InnerProductSpace.toDual_apply_apply, smul_eq_mul]\n+      ring\n+  refine ⟨hg, ?_⟩\n+  rw [divergence, hg.fderiv_apply]\n+  rw [inner_sub_right, real_inner_self_eq_norm_sq, norm_sub_sq_real]\n+  rw [real_inner_comm y x]\n+  ring\n+\n+end BanditRL.OnlineBregman\n+\n+namespace BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman\n+\n+variable {E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E]\n+    [FiniteDimensional ℝ E]\n+\n+theorem euclidean_variable_regret (V : Set E) (hV : Convex ℝ V)\n+    (hVn : V.Nonempty) (hVc : IsClosed V)\n+    (η : ℕ → ℝ) (loss : ℕ → E → EReal)\n+    (x0 : E) (x : ℕ → E) (T : ℕ) (hT : 0 < T)\n+    (hη : ∀ t < T, 0 < η t) (hinit : x 0 = x0)\n+    (hmono : ∀ t, t + 1 < T → η (t + 1) ≤ η t)\n+    (hbot : ∀ t < T, ∀ z, loss t z ≠ ⊥)\n+    (hdom : ∀ t < T, V ⊆ BanditRL.OnlineConvex.effectiveDomain (loss t))\n+    (hs : ∀ t < T, ∀ z ∈ V,\n+      (BanditRL.OnlineConvex.SourceSubdifferential (loss t) z).Nonempty)\n+    (hmin : ∀ t < T, x (t + 1) ∈ V ∧\n+      IsMinOn (fun z => loss t z + ((‖z - x t‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η t) : ℝ) : EReal))\n+        V (x (t + 1))) (u : E) (hu : u ∈ V) :\n+    (∀ t ≤ T, iterate V (fun z : E => ‖z‖ ^ 2 / 2) η loss x0 t = some (x t)) ∧\n+    (∑ t ∈ range T, ((loss t (x (t + 1))).toReal - (loss t u).toReal)) ≤\n+      ((range T).sup' (nonempty_range_iff.mpr (Nat.ne_of_gt hT))\n+        (fun t => ‖u - x t‖ ^ 2 / 2)) / η (T - 1) -\n+      ∑ t ∈ range T, ‖x (t + 1) - x t‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η t) := by\n+  classical\n+  let ψ : E → ℝ := fun z => ‖z‖ ^ 2 / 2\n+  have hgeometry (a b : E) : divergence ψ a b = ‖a - b‖ ^ 2 / 2 :=\n+    (quadratic_geometry a b).2\n+  have hψ : StrictConvexOn ℝ (univ : Set E) ψ := by\n+    have hstrong : StrongConvexOn (univ : Set E) 1 ψ := by\n+      rw [strongConvexOn_iff_convex]\n+      have he : (fun z : E => ψ z - (1 : ℝ) / 2 * ‖z‖ ^ 2) = fun _ => (0 : ℝ) := by\n+        funext z\n+        dsimp [ψ]\n+        ring\n+      rw [he]\n+      exact convexOn_const 0 convex_univ\n+    exact hstrong.strictConvexOn (by norm_num)\n+  have hd : DifferentiableOn ℝ ψ (interior (univ : Set E)) := by\n+    intro z _\n+    exact (quadratic_geometry z z).1.hasFDerivAt.differentiableAt.differentiableWithinAt\n+  have hc : Continuous ψ :=\n+    (show Differentiable ℝ ψ from fun z =>\n+      (quadratic_geometry z z).1.hasFDerivAt.differentiableAt).continuous\n+  have hclosed : BanditRL.OnlineConvex.SourceClosed (fun z =>\n+      (ψ z : EReal) + BanditRL.OnlineConvex.extendedIndicator univ z) := by\n+    intro a\n+    simpa only [BanditRL.OnlineConvex.extendedIndicator, mem_univ, if_true,\n+      EReal.coe_zero, add_zero, EReal.coe_le_coe_iff] using\n+      (isClosed_le hc (continuous_const : Continuous (fun _ : E => a)))\n+  have hf (t : ℕ) (ht : t < T) : BanditRL.OnlineConvex.SourceProper (loss t) :=\n+    BanditRL.OnlineConvex.sourceProper_of_domain (loss t) V hVn (hbot t ht) (hdom t ht)\n+\n+  have hm : ∀ t < T, x (t + 1) ∈ V ∧\n+      IsMinOn (fun z => loss t z + (((η t)⁻¹ * divergence ψ z (x t) : ℝ) : EReal))\n+        V (x (t + 1)) := by\n+    intro t ht\n+    simpa only [hgeometry, div_eq_mul_inv, mul_inv_rev, mul_comm, mul_left_comm,\n+      mul_assoc] using hmin t ht\n+  have hrun := iterate_eq_of_source_updates V univ hV (fun _ _ => mem_univ _)\n+    ψ hψ η loss x0 x T hinit hη hf hs hm\n+  refine ⟨hrun, ?_⟩\n+  have hb := source_variable_regret V univ hV hVn hVc (fun _ _ => mem_univ _)\n+    ψ hψ hclosed hd η loss x0 x T hT hη hinit (by simp) hmono hbot hdom hs hm u hu\n+  simpa only [hgeometry, div_eq_mul_inv, mul_inv_rev, mul_comm, mul_left_comm,\n+    mul_assoc] using hb\n+\n+theorem euclidean_fixed_regret (V : Set E) (hV : Convex ℝ V)\n+    (hVn : V.Nonempty) (hVc : IsClosed V)\n+    (η : ℝ) (hη : 0 < η) (loss : ℕ → E → EReal)\n+    (x0 : E) (x : ℕ → E) (T : ℕ) (hinit : x 0 = x0)\n+    (hbot : ∀ t < T, ∀ z, loss t z ≠ ⊥)\n+    (hdom : ∀ t < T, V ⊆ BanditRL.OnlineConvex.effectiveDomain (loss t))\n+    (hs : ∀ t < T, ∀ z ∈ V,\n+      (BanditRL.OnlineConvex.SourceSubdifferential (loss t) z).Nonempty)\n+    (hmin : ∀ t < T, x (t + 1) ∈ V ∧\n+      IsMinOn (fun z => loss t z + ((‖z - x t‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η) : ℝ) : EReal))\n+        V (x (t + 1))) (u : E) (hu : u ∈ V) :\n+    (∀ t ≤ T, iterate V (fun z : E => ‖z‖ ^ 2 / 2) (fun _ => η) loss x0 t = some (x t)) ∧\n+    (∑ t ∈ range T, ((loss t (x (t + 1))).toReal - (loss t u).toReal)) ≤\n+      ‖u - x0‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η) -\n+      (∑ t ∈ range T, ‖x (t + 1) - x t‖ ^ 2) / (2 * η) := by\n+  classical\n+  let ψ : E → ℝ := fun z => ‖z‖ ^ 2 / 2\n+  have hgeometry (a b : E) : divergence ψ a b = ‖a - b‖ ^ 2 / 2 :=\n+    (quadratic_geometry a b).2\n+  have hψ : StrictConvexOn ℝ (univ : Set E) ψ := by\n+    have hstrong : StrongConvexOn (univ : Set E) 1 ψ := by\n+      rw [strongConvexOn_iff_convex]\n+      have he : (fun z : E => ψ z - (1 : ℝ) / 2 * ‖z‖ ^ 2) = fun _ => (0 : ℝ) := by\n+        funext z\n+        dsimp [ψ]\n+        ring\n+      rw [he]\n+      exact convexOn_const 0 convex_univ\n+    exact hstrong.strictConvexOn (by norm_num)\n+  have hd : DifferentiableOn ℝ ψ (interior (univ : Set E)) := by\n+    intro z _\n+    exact (quadratic_geometry z z).1.hasFDerivAt.differentiableAt.differentiableWithinAt\n+  have hc : Continuous ψ :=\n+    (show Differentiable ℝ ψ from fun z =>\n+      (quadratic_geometry z z).1.hasFDerivAt.differentiableAt).continuous\n+  have hclosed : BanditRL.OnlineConvex.SourceClosed (fun z =>\n+      (ψ z : EReal) + BanditRL.OnlineConvex.extendedIndicator univ z) := by\n+    intro a\n+    simpa only [BanditRL.OnlineConvex.extendedIndicator, mem_univ, if_true,\n+      EReal.coe_zero, add_zero, EReal.coe_le_coe_iff] using\n+      (isClosed_le hc (continuous_const : Continuous (fun _ : E => a)))\n+  have hf (t : ℕ) (ht : t < T) : BanditRL.OnlineConvex.SourceProper (loss t) :=\n+    BanditRL.OnlineConvex.sourceProper_of_domain (loss t) V hVn (hbot t ht) (hdom t ht)\n+\n+  have hm : ∀ t < T, x (t + 1) ∈ V ∧\n+      IsMinOn (fun z => loss t z + ((η⁻¹ * divergence ψ z (x t) : ℝ) : EReal))\n+        V (x (t + 1)) := by\n+    intro t ht\n+    simpa only [hgeometry, div_eq_mul_inv, mul_inv_rev, mul_comm, mul_left_comm,\n+      mul_assoc] using hmin t ht\n+  have hrun := iterate_eq_of_source_updates V univ hV (fun _ _ => mem_univ _)\n+    ψ hψ (fun _ => η) loss x0 x T hinit (fun _ _ => hη) hf hs hm\n+  refine ⟨hrun, ?_⟩\n+  have hb := source_fixed_regret V univ hV hVn hVc (fun _ _ => mem_univ _)\n+    ψ hψ hclosed hd η hη loss x0 x T hinit (by simp) hbot hdom hs hm u hu\n+  simp only [hgeometry] at hb\n+  have hsum : (∑ t ∈ range T, ‖x (t + 1) - x t‖ ^ 2 / 2) =\n+      (∑ t ∈ range T, ‖x (t + 1) - x t‖ ^ 2) / 2 := by\n+    simp only [div_eq_mul_inv, Finset.sum_mul]\n+  rw [hsum] at hb\n+  simpa only [div_div, mul_comm] using hb\n+\n+end BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman"},{"sha":"d67cc77beb7ce4c5ae37aa994ec0e764f67b82e1","filename":"CONTRIBUTING.md","status":"modified","additions":11,"deletions":4,"changes":15,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/CONTRIBUTING.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/CONTRIBUTING.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/CONTRIBUTING.md?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -15,9 +15,11 @@ current target branch and read:\n 2. `CONTRIBUTING.md`\n 3. `docs/contributor-codex-contract.md`\n 4. `docs/theorem-publication-protocol.md`\n-5. `.agents/skills/bandit-substantive-advance/SKILL.md`\n-6. `.agents/skills/bandit-semantic-roundtrip/SKILL.md`\n-7. the relevant domain skill and exact source/route files.\n+5. `docs/proof-digestion-protocol.md`\n+6. `docs/evidence-routed-memory-protocol.md`\n+7. `.agents/skills/bandit-substantive-advance/SKILL.md`\n+8. `.agents/skills/bandit-semantic-roundtrip/SKILL.md`\n+9. the relevant domain skill and exact source/route files.\n \n The reusable bootstrap for coding agents is\n `.agents/prompts/collaborator-contribution.md`. Repository-local instructions\n@@ -68,7 +70,12 @@ fails closed.\n \n Lean compilation certifies a proposition, not that it is the theorem cited in a\n paper or book. For every source-facing theorem, follow\n-`.agents/skills/bandit-semantic-roundtrip/SKILL.md`.\n+`.agents/skills/bandit-semantic-roundtrip/SKILL.md` and\n+`docs/proof-digestion-protocol.md` and `docs/evidence-routed-memory-protocol.md`. Freeze the exact theorem interface before\n+proof search; treat proof ingredients as edges rather than binders; reconstruct\n+the source proof topology independently of Lean implementation topology; and\n+run the purification gate after integration before calling the result fully\n+digested for researchers. New source-facing contribution manifests should use schema 3.0 so typed failure, salvage, evidence-gated parallelism, cross-route blind-spot review, and reader-backpressure/Exposition-Seal state are machine checked.\n \n The formalizer, source-blind decoder, and anti-anchored source reviewer must be\n distinct actors. The reader must expose the source anchor, natural-language"},{"sha":"c70f18353c3b0571cc285f2a1257c76e1b2d7c27","filename":"MANIFEST.md","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/MANIFEST.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/MANIFEST.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/MANIFEST.md?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -15590,3 +15590,5 @@ Orabona v10 unnumberedexample afterT2.30/endSection2.2.1 immediatelybefore2.2.2\n - `2026-10-08T15:56:17+00:00` `bandit.py reference-index` `retrieval-index` `research-wiki/retrieval-index/local_lean_declarations.json` - refreshed local_lean_declarations.json\n - `2026-10-08T17:35:26+00:00` `bandit.py new-task` `task` `tasks/ONLINE-FTL-LIMIT-20261009.md` - Actual FTL best regret and fixed-comparator ordinary-limit criterion\n - `2026-10-08T18:45:32+00:00` `bandit.py new-task` `task` `tasks/ONLINE-FTL-OBSTRUCTION-20261009.md` - Actual bounded FTL ordinary-limit reconciliation\n+\n+Prescient Euclidean source specialization: `BanditRLProof/OnlinePrescientEuclidean.lean` proves one shared actual-gradient/divergence identity and both general extended-loss, same-Option-run specializations of Orabona v10 Theorem15.30. `Tests/OnlinePrescientEuclideanCanary.lean` contains two complete nonlinear finite-domain actual-run canaries. Source topology, frozen interfaces, independent reviews and failed attempts are retained in `runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011`; package validation is recorded separately. Seven required Chapter2 forward containers and six future claims, including the B4 terminal corrections, remain open. Chapter2 is partial; the Chapters1-16 Goal remains active. Unmerged and unpublished."},{"sha":"a564de6f930ff92681c69e57b433b77a261c2569","filename":"README.md","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/README.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/README.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/README.md?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@ This repository has two connected contributions:\n \n ## 📰 News\n \n+- **2026-10 — Proof digestion + evidence memory.** BanditRLlib now seals source-facing theorem interfaces before proof search, salvages verified fragments from failed routes, separates mathematical refutation from API/environment failure, keeps scheduler changes matched-experiment gated, audits common blind spots across parallel proof routes, and requires an Exposition Seal before PURIFIED reader release.\n - **2026-09 — Harness self-comparison.** Structured logs can compare hierarchical and master–worker runs and prepare a bounded GPT diagnosis; zero valid matched pairs means no winner is claimed.\n - **2026-09 — Textbook spine.** Ten teaching chapters and Part-IV Chapters 13–17 now link source pages, algorithms, theorem statements, Lean evidence, and named gaps.\n - **2026-09 — SGB frontier.** The finite missing-pull regret consumer compiles, while the source phase trigger and Theorem 2 terminal remain open."},{"sha":"f5a6cfd7726a75b251998266011adcb754a72364","filename":"Tests.lean","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/Tests.lean","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/Tests.lean","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/Tests.lean?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -207,3 +207,4 @@ import Tests.OnlineAdaptivePotentialCanary\n import Tests.OnlineAdaptiveOSDCanary\n import Tests.OnlineWeightedPotentialCanary\n import Tests.OnlineUnboundedOGDCanary\n+import Tests.OnlinePrescientEuclideanCanary"},{"sha":"2a32e44891972751c7066bc4b5c8757b3f9a0bde","filename":"Tests/OnlinePrescientEuclideanCanary.lean","status":"added","additions":213,"deletions":0,"changes":213,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/Tests%2FOnlinePrescientEuclideanCanary.lean","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/Tests%2FOnlinePrescientEuclideanCanary.lean","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/Tests%2FOnlinePrescientEuclideanCanary.lean?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,213 @@\n+import BanditRLProof.OnlinePrescientEuclidean\n+import Tests.OnlineSubgradientBasicCanary\n+import Mathlib.Tactic\n+\n+noncomputable section\n+open Set Finset\n+open BanditRL.OnlineConvex BanditRL.OnlineBregman BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman\n+set_option autoImplicit false\n+namespace PrescientEuclideanProbe\n+\n+theorem variable_quadratic_actual_run :\n+    let V : Set ℝ := Icc 0 2\n+    let loss : ℕ → ℝ → EReal := fun _ z =>\n+      if z ∈ V then ((z ^ 2 / 2 : ℝ) : EReal) else ⊤\n+    let η : ℕ → ℝ := fun t => if t = 0 then 1 else 1 / 2\n+    let x : ℕ → ℝ := fun t => if t = 0 then 2 else if t = 1 then 1 else 2 / 3\n+    Convex ℝ V ∧ V.Nonempty ∧ IsClosed V ∧\n+    (∀ t, SourceProper (loss t) ∧ IsConvexExtended (loss t) ∧\n+      effectiveDomain (loss t) = V) ∧\n+    (∀ t, ∀ z ∈ V, z ∈ SourceSubdifferential (loss t) z) ∧\n+    loss 0 3 = ⊤ ∧\n+    (loss 0 0).toReal + (loss 0 2).toReal ≠ 2 * (loss 0 1).toReal ∧\n+    (∀ t, 0 < η t) ∧ (∀ t, η (t + 1) ≤ η t) ∧\n+    η 0 = 1 ∧ η 1 = 1 / 2 ∧\n+    x 0 = 2 ∧ x 1 = 1 ∧ x 2 = 2 / 3 ∧\n+    (∀ t < 2, x (t + 1) ∈ V ∧\n+      IsMinOn (fun z => loss t z + ((‖z - x t‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η t) : ℝ) : EReal))\n+        V (x (t + 1))) ∧\n+    (∀ t ≤ 2, iterate V (fun z : ℝ => ‖z‖ ^ 2 / 2) η loss 2 t = some (x t)) ∧\n+    (∑ t ∈ range 2, ((loss t (x (t + 1))).toReal - (loss t 0).toReal)) = 13 / 18 ∧\n+    (∑ t ∈ range 2, ((loss t (x t)).toReal - (loss t 0).toReal)) = 5 / 2 ∧\n+    ‖x 1 - x 0‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η 0) = 1 / 2 ∧\n+    ‖x 2 - x 1‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η 1) = 1 / 9 ∧\n+    (∑ t ∈ range 2, ‖x (t + 1) - x t‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η t)) = 11 / 18 ∧\n+    (∀ u ∈ V,\n+      (∑ t ∈ range 2, ((loss t (x (t + 1))).toReal - (loss t u).toReal)) ≤\n+      ((range 2).sup' (nonempty_range_iff.mpr (by decide : (2 : ℕ) ≠ 0))\n+        (fun t => ‖u - x t‖ ^ 2 / 2)) / η 1 -\n+      ∑ t ∈ range 2, ‖x (t + 1) - x t‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η t)) ∧\n+    (13 / 18 : ℝ) ≤ 61 / 18 := by\n+  classical\n+  dsimp only\n+  let V : Set ℝ := Icc 0 2\n+  let loss : ℕ → ℝ → EReal := fun _ z =>\n+    if z ∈ V then ((z ^ 2 / 2 : ℝ) : EReal) else ⊤\n+  let η : ℕ → ℝ := fun t => if t = 0 then 1 else 1 / 2\n+  let x : ℕ → ℝ := fun t => if t = 0 then 2 else if t = 1 then 1 else 2 / 3\n+  have hV : Convex ℝ V := convex_Icc 0 2\n+  have hVn : V.Nonempty := ⟨0, by norm_num [V]⟩\n+  have hVc : IsClosed V := isClosed_Icc\n+  have hzero : (0 : ℝ) ∈ V := by norm_num [V]\n+  have hbot (t : ℕ) (z : ℝ) : loss t z ≠ ⊥ := by\n+    by_cases hz : z ∈ V <;> simp [loss, hz]\n+  have hdom (t : ℕ) : effectiveDomain (loss t) = V := by\n+    ext z\n+    by_cases hz : z ∈ V <;> simp [effectiveDomain, loss, hz]\n+  have hp (t : ℕ) : SourceProper (loss t) :=\n+    sourceProper_of_domain (loss t) V hVn (hbot t) (by rw [hdom t])\n+  have hs (t : ℕ) (z : ℝ) (hz : z ∈ V) :\n+      z ∈ SourceSubdifferential (loss t) z := by\n+    intro y\n+    by_cases hy : y ∈ V\n+    · have hold := SubgradientProbe.square_support z y\n+      simp only [← EReal.coe_add, EReal.coe_le_coe_iff] at hold\n+      change z ^ 2 + (y - z) * (2 * z) ≤ y ^ 2 at hold\n+      simp only [loss, if_pos hz, if_pos hy, ← EReal.coe_add, EReal.coe_le_coe_iff]\n+      change z ^ 2 / 2 + (y - z) * z ≤ y ^ 2 / 2\n+      nlinarith only [hold]\n+    · simp only [loss, if_neg hy]\n+      exact le_top\n+  have hregular (t : ℕ) : SourceProper (loss t) ∧ IsConvexExtended (loss t) ∧\n+      effectiveDomain (loss t) = V := by\n+    refine ⟨hp t, ?_, hdom t⟩\n+    apply (convexExtended_iff_toReal (loss t) (hbot t)).mpr\n+    rw [hdom t]\n+    exact finitePart_convex_of_subdifferentiable (loss t) V hV (hp t)\n+      (fun z hz => ⟨z, hs t z hz⟩)\n+  have hη (t : ℕ) : 0 < η t := by\n+    by_cases ht : t = 0 <;> norm_num [η, ht]\n+  have hmono (t : ℕ) : η (t + 1) ≤ η t := by\n+    by_cases ht : t = 0 <;> simp [η, ht] <;> norm_num\n+  have hm : ∀ t < 2, x (t + 1) ∈ V ∧\n+      IsMinOn (fun z => loss t z + ((‖z - x t‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η t) : ℝ) : EReal))\n+        V (x (t + 1)) := by\n+    intro t ht\n+    have ht01 : t = 0 ∨ t = 1 := by omega\n+    have hxp : x (t + 1) ∈ V := by\n+      rcases ht01 with rfl | rfl <;> norm_num [x, V]\n+    refine ⟨hxp, ?_⟩\n+    intro z hz\n+    change loss t (x (t + 1)) + _ ≤ loss t z + _\n+    dsimp only [loss]\n+    rw [if_pos hxp, if_pos hz, ← EReal.coe_add, ← EReal.coe_add, EReal.coe_le_coe_iff]\n+    rcases ht01 with rfl | rfl\n+    · norm_num [x, η, Real.norm_eq_abs, sq_abs]\n+      nlinarith [sq_nonneg (z - 1)]\n+    · norm_num [x, η, Real.norm_eq_abs, sq_abs]\n+      nlinarith [sq_nonneg (z - (2 / 3 : ℝ))]\n+  have hcore (u : ℝ) (hu : u ∈ V) :=\n+    euclidean_variable_regret V hV hVn hVc η loss 2 x 2 (by decide)\n+      (fun t _ => hη t) (by norm_num [x]) (fun t _ => hmono t)\n+      (fun t _ z => hbot t z) (fun t _ => by rw [hdom t])\n+      (fun t _ z hz => ⟨z, hs t z hz⟩) hm u hu\n+  have hbound (u : ℝ) (hu : u ∈ V) := (hcore u hu).2\n+  have hnum : (13 / 18 : ℝ) ≤ 61 / 18 := by\n+    have hb := hbound 0 hzero\n+    convert hb using 1 <;>\n+      norm_num [show range 2 = {0, 1} from by decide, Finset.sup'_insert, Finset.sup'_singleton,\n+        loss, V, x, η, Real.norm_eq_abs]\n+  refine ⟨hV, hVn, hVc, hregular, hs, ?_, ?_, hη, hmono, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_,\n+    hm, (hcore 0 hzero).1, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, hbound, hnum⟩ <;>\n+    norm_num [sum_range_succ, loss, V, x, η, Real.norm_eq_abs]\n+\n+theorem fixed_quadratic_actual_run :\n+    let V : Set ℝ := Icc 0 2\n+    let loss : ℕ → ℝ → EReal := fun _ z =>\n+      if z ∈ V then ((z ^ 2 / 2 : ℝ) : EReal) else ⊤\n+    let η : ℕ → ℝ := fun _ => 1\n+    let x : ℕ → ℝ := fun t => if t = 0 then 2 else if t = 1 then 1 else 1 / 2\n+    Convex ℝ V ∧ V.Nonempty ∧ IsClosed V ∧\n+    (∀ t, SourceProper (loss t) ∧ IsConvexExtended (loss t) ∧\n+      effectiveDomain (loss t) = V) ∧\n+    (∀ t, ∀ z ∈ V, z ∈ SourceSubdifferential (loss t) z) ∧\n+    loss 0 3 = ⊤ ∧\n+    (loss 0 0).toReal + (loss 0 2).toReal ≠ 2 * (loss 0 1).toReal ∧\n+    (∀ t, 0 < η t) ∧ (∀ t, η (t + 1) ≤ η t) ∧\n+    η 0 = 1 ∧ η 1 = 1 ∧\n+    x 0 = 2 ∧ x 1 = 1 ∧ x 2 = 1 / 2 ∧\n+    (∀ t < 2, x (t + 1) ∈ V ∧\n+      IsMinOn (fun z => loss t z + ((‖z - x t‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η t) : ℝ) : EReal))\n+        V (x (t + 1))) ∧\n+    (∀ t ≤ 2, iterate V (fun z : ℝ => ‖z‖ ^ 2 / 2) η loss 2 t = some (x t)) ∧\n+    (∑ t ∈ range 2, ((loss t (x (t + 1))).toReal - (loss t 0).toReal)) = 5 / 8 ∧\n+    (∑ t ∈ range 2, ((loss t (x t)).toReal - (loss t 0).toReal)) = 5 / 2 ∧\n+    ‖x 1 - x 0‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η 0) = 1 / 2 ∧\n+    ‖x 2 - x 1‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η 1) = 1 / 8 ∧\n+    (∑ t ∈ range 2, ‖x (t + 1) - x t‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η t)) = 5 / 8 ∧\n+    (∀ u ∈ V,\n+      (∑ t ∈ range 2, ((loss t (x (t + 1))).toReal - (loss t u).toReal)) ≤\n+      ‖u - (2 : ℝ)‖ ^ 2 / (2 * 1) -\n+      (∑ t ∈ range 2, ‖x (t + 1) - x t‖ ^ 2) / (2 * 1)) ∧\n+    (5 / 8 : ℝ) ≤ 11 / 8 := by\n+  classical\n+  dsimp only\n+  let V : Set ℝ := Icc 0 2\n+  let loss : ℕ → ℝ → EReal := fun _ z =>\n+    if z ∈ V then ((z ^ 2 / 2 : ℝ) : EReal) else ⊤\n+  let η : ℕ → ℝ := fun _ => 1\n+  let x : ℕ → ℝ := fun t => if t = 0 then 2 else if t = 1 then 1 else 1 / 2\n+  have hV : Convex ℝ V := convex_Icc 0 2\n+  have hVn : V.Nonempty := ⟨0, by norm_num [V]⟩\n+  have hVc : IsClosed V := isClosed_Icc\n+  have hzero : (0 : ℝ) ∈ V := by norm_num [V]\n+  have hbot (t : ℕ) (z : ℝ) : loss t z ≠ ⊥ := by\n+    by_cases hz : z ∈ V <;> simp [loss, hz]\n+  have hdom (t : ℕ) : effectiveDomain (loss t) = V := by\n+    ext z\n+    by_cases hz : z ∈ V <;> simp [effectiveDomain, loss, hz]\n+  have hp (t : ℕ) : SourceProper (loss t) :=\n+    sourceProper_of_domain (loss t) V hVn (hbot t) (by rw [hdom t])\n+  have hs (t : ℕ) (z : ℝ) (hz : z ∈ V) :\n+      z ∈ SourceSubdifferential (loss t) z := by\n+    intro y\n+    by_cases hy : y ∈ V\n+    · have hold := SubgradientProbe.square_support z y\n+      simp only [← EReal.coe_add, EReal.coe_le_coe_iff] at hold\n+      change z ^ 2 + (y - z) * (2 * z) ≤ y ^ 2 at hold\n+      simp only [loss, if_pos hz, if_pos hy, ← EReal.coe_add, EReal.coe_le_coe_iff]\n+      change z ^ 2 / 2 + (y - z) * z ≤ y ^ 2 / 2\n+      nlinarith only [hold]\n+    · simp only [loss, if_neg hy]\n+      exact le_top\n+  have hregular (t : ℕ) : SourceProper (loss t) ∧ IsConvexExtended (loss t) ∧\n+      effectiveDomain (loss t) = V := by\n+    refine ⟨hp t, ?_, hdom t⟩\n+    apply (convexExtended_iff_toReal (loss t) (hbot t)).mpr\n+    rw [hdom t]\n+    exact finitePart_convex_of_subdifferentiable (loss t) V hV (hp t)\n+      (fun z hz => ⟨z, hs t z hz⟩)\n+  have hη (t : ℕ) : 0 < η t := by\n+    norm_num [η]\n+  have hmono (t : ℕ) : η (t + 1) ≤ η t := by\n+    norm_num [η]\n+  have hm : ∀ t < 2, x (t + 1) ∈ V ∧\n+      IsMinOn (fun z => loss t z + ((‖z - x t‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η t) : ℝ) : EReal))\n+        V (x (t + 1)) := by\n+    intro t ht\n+    have ht01 : t = 0 ∨ t = 1 := by omega\n+    have hxp : x (t + 1) ∈ V := by\n+      rcases ht01 with rfl | rfl <;> norm_num [x, V]\n+    refine ⟨hxp, ?_⟩\n+    intro z hz\n+    change loss t (x (t + 1)) + _ ≤ loss t z + _\n+    dsimp only [loss]\n+    rw [if_pos hxp, if_pos hz, ← EReal.coe_add, ← EReal.coe_add, EReal.coe_le_coe_iff]\n+    rcases ht01 with rfl | rfl\n+    · norm_num [x, η, Real.norm_eq_abs, sq_abs]\n+      nlinarith [sq_nonneg (z - 1)]\n+    · norm_num [x, η, Real.norm_eq_abs, sq_abs]\n+      nlinarith [sq_nonneg (z - (1 / 2 : ℝ))]\n+  have hcore (u : ℝ) (hu : u ∈ V) :=\n+    euclidean_fixed_regret V hV hVn hVc 1 (by norm_num) loss 2 x 2\n+      (by norm_num [x]) (fun t _ z => hbot t z) (fun t _ => by rw [hdom t])\n+      (fun t _ z hz => ⟨z, hs t z hz⟩) hm u hu\n+  have hbound (u : ℝ) (hu : u ∈ V) := (hcore u hu).2\n+  have hnum : (5 / 8 : ℝ) ≤ 11 / 8 := by\n+    have hb := hbound 0 hzero\n+    convert hb using 1 <;> norm_num [sum_range_succ, loss, V, x, η, Real.norm_eq_abs]\n+  refine ⟨hV, hVn, hVc, hregular, hs, ?_, ?_, hη, hmono, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_,\n+    hm, (hcore 0 hzero).1, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, hbound, hnum⟩ <;>\n+    norm_num [sum_range_succ, loss, V, x, η, Real.norm_eq_abs]\n+\n+end PrescientEuclideanProbe"},{"sha":"673d24460bf6593cf4c067f9a04fcaee34c69335","filename":"docs/contracts/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1/.gitattributes","status":"added","additions":3,"deletions":0,"changes":3,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/docs%2Fcontracts%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1%2F.gitattributes","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/docs%2Fcontracts%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1%2F.gitattributes","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/docs%2Fcontracts%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1%2F.gitattributes?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+* -text\n+neutral-frozen-*.txt whitespace=-blank-at-eof\n+*.json whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol"},{"sha":"5ed1aeb739468890b5eeba2b005e5fd6f8094910","filename":"docs/contracts/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1/canary-freeze-receipt-v1.json","status":"added","additions":72,"deletions":0,"changes":72,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/docs%2Fcontracts%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1%2Fcanary-freeze-receipt-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/docs%2Fcont