uasipolynomial-Time-October-5-2026\",\n+      \"priority\": \"C\",\n+      \"class\": \"benchmark-only\",\n+      \"local_role\": \"RL-adjacent stochastic-game route, not an MDP theorem\",\n+      \"upstream_verification\": {\n+        \"status\": \"manuscript-only-in-current-audit\"\n+      },\n+      \"next_action\": \"audit state/action/transition/policy/player quantifiers and only then decide whether any dynamic-programming or policy lemma is reusable\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"out_of_scope_keyword_matches\": [\n+    \"lean/OAI/Combinatorics/EditApproximation/**/Regret*.lean\"\n+  ],\n+  \"hard_guards\": [\n+    \"Adjacent online-selection results do not count as bandit or RL theorem completion.\",\n+    \"A static experiment lower bound requires an explicit proved reduction before becoming a bandit/RL lower bound.\",\n+    \"Quantum semantics are owned by QuantumComputinglib/ASPBE at the cross-library boundary.\",\n+    \"No solid graph edge without local compiled evidence.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"execution_order\": [\n+    \"oai-matroid-prophet\",\n+    \"oai-matroid-secretary\",\n+    \"oai-boolean-noise\",\n+    \"oai-soft-channel\",\n+    \"oai-gaussian-information\",\n+    \"oai-gaussian-regression\",\n+    \"oai-memory-precision\",\n+    \"oai-stochastic-mean-payoff-games\"\n+  ]\n+}"},{"sha":"8935055f1ab9da1b9e7ee5a472b81d95c8ff18a9","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/.gitattributes","status":"added","additions":10,"deletions":0,"changes":10,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2F.gitattributes","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2F.gitattributes","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2F.gitattributes?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@\n+* -text\n+*.txt -diff\n+*.raw -diff\n+*.py -diff\n+*.stdout -diff\n+*.stderr -diff\n+*.json whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol\n+*.md whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol\n+*.snapshot -diff\n+upstream-compatibility-v1/upstream-files/** -diff"},{"sha":"3a2adbd0e2af0f65af6fd2ec85ca5aeb0154fbe1","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/accepted-bounded-package-v1.json","status":"added","additions":92,"deletions":0,"changes":92,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Faccepted-bounded-package-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Faccepted-bounded-package-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Faccepted-bounded-package-v1.json?ref=2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,92 @@\n+{\n+  \"utc\": \"2026-10-11T07:48:01.589303+00:00\",\n+  \"actor\": \"/root\",\n+  \"decision\": \"accepted-local bounded prescient Euclidean package only\",\n+  \"source_candidate_HEAD\": \"3b393adb009bc25a2c6e3fa3148bf9a3a2b4c376\",\n+  \"core\": {\n+    \"path\": \"BanditRLProof/OnlinePrescientEuclidean.lean\",\n+    \"sha256\": \"9b755a12d540c1039b068e4b97af90ac483a58fd1a8b40af9c806264f95d42b8\"\n+  },\n+  \"canaries\": {\n+    \"path\": \"Tests/OnlinePrescientEuclideanCanary.lean\",\n+    \"sha256\": \"dbc2a2f7660e70517a6f50826944976aa9cbbba17e37f88b8bac9fbef97e0122\"\n+  },\n+  \"independent_FINAL\": {\n+    \"path\": \"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/final-validation-evidence-v1/fresh-independent-final-review-v1.json\",\n+    \"sha256\": \"50ebc5f41c81598692cd3bfc28aa058abeccdc9abfc60a9a6e34efb2bea21d24\"\n+  },\n+  \"source_target_join\": {\n+    \"path\": \"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/final-validation-evidence-v1/candidate-source-join-v1/candidate-source-join-v1.json\",\n+    \"sha256\": \"c59acb46bbbaf4bcae8de6b294e07f698ba421e8c90053701a7983b7a3093244\"\n+  },\n+  \"exact_gate_port\": {\n+    \"path\": \"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/final-validation-evidence-port-v1.json\",\n+    \"sha256\": \"80e3b0f3492c102b026a7a7493674d720e1a6b6cfc63d1930bdb78445465fef5\"\n+  },\n+  \"accepted_source_targets\": [\n+    {\n+      \"target_id\": \"later:lookahead/branch-03\",\n+      \"frozen_row\": {\n+        \"target_id\": \"later:lookahead/branch-03\",\n+        \"source_id\": \"additional:prescient-lookahead-nonpositive-stability\",\n+        \"scope_tag\": \"mainrequired\",\n+        \"domain\": \"Finite-dimensional real Euclidean space unless explicitly quantified otherwise\",\n+        \"assumptions\": \"Exactly the explicit premises in effective_statement and named child interfaces; no historical recommendation adds premises implicitly\",\n+        \"effective_statement\": \"Euclidean psi(x)=||x||^2/2 specializes the negative stability term to -sum||x_t-x_(t-1)||^2/(2eta_t), with no positive gradient-square term. The total bound need not be nonpositive because the initial comparator potential is positive.\",\n+        \"branch\": \"later-source branch\",\n+        \"status\": \"retained later target; independent approval/proof pending\",\n+        \"implementation_acceptance\": false,\n+        \"source_locator\": {\n+          \"pdf_pages_1based\": [\n+            277,\n+            278\n+          ],\n+          \"printed_pages\": [\n+            265,\n+            266\n+          ],\n+          \"marker\": \"Algorithm 15.8\",\n+          \"excerpt\": \"Algorithm 15.8Prescient Online Mirror Descent\\nRequire:Non-empty closed convexV ⊂ X ⊆R d,ψ:X →Rstrictly convex and\\ndifferentiable onintX,x 0 ∈intX,η 1, . . . , ηT >0\\n1:fort= 1toTdo\\n2:Receiveℓ t :R d →(−∞,+∞], whereV ⊆domℓ t\\n3:x t ∈argmin x∈V ℓt(x) + 1\\nηt\\nBψ(x;xt−1)\\n4:Pay the lossℓ t(xt)\\n5:end for\\n15.5.1 Prescient Online Mirror Descent and Be-The-Regularized-Leader\\nThe results in the previous section are interesting from a game-theoretic point of view, be-\\ncause they show that two players can converge to an equilibrium without any “communica-\\ntio\",\n+          \"excerpt_sha256\": \"fd74bb527b82b529cefe9258768e11c463cbaf9d8a38435b750da4836eca0cb0\"\n+        },\n+        \"semantic_decisions_pending\": [],\n+        \"proof_body_ready\": false,\n+        \"proof_body_ready_reason\": \"No next proof before distinct effective-target freeze approval; listed semantic decisions and open repairs remain explicit.\",\n+        \"claim_kind\": \"mathematical target or required repair obligation\"\n+      },\n+      \"frozen_row_sha256\": \"083ed6fb0537459192d66fbecc3016621e079b8d4bf21d90a093ffb609aa4845\",\n+      \"accepted_meaning\": \"Explicit Euclidean specialization of SAME conditional partial actual run, with both source signed endpoints and actual gradient/divergence API.\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"frozen_inventory_unchanged\": {\n+    \"path\": \"docs/contracts/online-ch2-complete-target-freeze-v1/effective-targets-frozen-v3.2.json\",\n+    \"sha256\": \"61cf1901a632aeee35ee71511ba53b115ae0958649ea78b786536a4404684ba1\"\n+  },\n+  \"forward_container_delta\": 0,\n+  \"open_required_forward_containers\": 7,\n+  \"open_future_mathematical_claims\": 6,\n+  \"mandatory_repairs_remaining\": [\n+    \"repair:7.47-terminal\",\n+    \"repair:15.31-terminal\"\n+  ],\n+  \"B1_B7_retained\": true,\n+  \"chapter2\": {\n+    \"status\": \"partial\",\n+    \"accepted\": false,\n+    \"complete_proof_denominator\": null\n+  },\n+  \"Goal\": \"ACTIVE; actual tool checked immediately before this parent action\",\n+  \"bounded_exposition_seal\": \"accepted in independent FINAL; contribution manifes