ries and numeric bound specialized from same all-u result.\",\n+    \"Ordered divergence half factors, negative movement squares, maxprevious excluding terminal, last used eta; fixedT0 without empty max.\",\n+    \"Hilbert geometry extension distinct finite-dimensional source consumers; fixed exercise mandatory. Sourcegap/B4 and7containers+6futureclaims open.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"learning_failure_class\": {\n+    \"current_recovered_route\": \"NONE may denote current successful verified implementation only.\",\n+    \"history\": \"Two core and one canary IMPLEMENTATION_FAILED attempts preserved. Packaging selfhash and GBK errors are process evidence, not negative mathematics.\",\n+    \"salvage\": \"Successful shared geometry/endpoints and selector compositions retained/reviewed. No failed fragment promoted by text alone; historical snapshots retained, no cleanup authorized.\",\n+    \"source_delta\": \"Author unresolved source justification is not REFUTED or SOURCE_INVALID; do not erase it under NONE.\"\n+  },\n+  \"next_requirements\": [\n+    \"Schema3 binds actual statement/binder/source topology/proof digestion/learning/purification records and this chronology.\",\n+    \"Fresh root/Tests/full harness/contributor/site/registry/personal visual gates after current-main integration.\",\n+    \"No Exposition Seal/PURIFIED until separately evidenced; no package/chapter/Goal/main/live/nativewholeloop acceptance.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"input_refs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs\\\\proof-digestion-protocol.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"8a183dde41c2b58f5c6a6e2fa4158ccc64ad3e427b9349110d15141aed254492\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs\\\\evidence-routed-memory-protocol.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"9e529672bb9706b245596e272024d4b38f3e5a32a5b54310ac70aa8d2118ccf7\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\process_memory.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"d85256d30393b733554a040c0f5fb729e70639e6734fc775ef0e920089a0c578\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"BanditRLProof\\\\O